#. Tag: menuchoice
#: commands-menus.docbook:1648
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Filter</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Colors</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Color "
"Transfer</guimenuitem>"
